{"id":"reference/for","kind":"langref","title":"for","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#for","file":"reference/for.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"for","text":"for"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Labeled-for","text":"带标签的 for"},{"depth":3,"slug":"inline-for","text":"inline for"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"for\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/for/#for\">for</a></h2>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_for.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"for basics\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> items = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// for 循环用于遍历切片和数组。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (items) |value| {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 支持 break 和 continue。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (value == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span>;\n        }\n        sum += value;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">16</span>, sum);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 若只遍历切片的一部分，先重新切片。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (items[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]) |value| {\n        sum += value;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">20</span>, sum);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 要获取迭代索引，需要指定第二个条件，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 并提供第二个捕获值。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum2: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (items, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..) |_, i| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(i));\n        sum2 += <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intCast</span>(i));\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, sum2);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用范围语法遍历连续整数。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 无界范围始终产生编译错误。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum3: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>) |i| {\n        sum3 += i;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, sum3);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"multi object for\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> items = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> items2 = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> count: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 同时遍历多个对象。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 循环开始时，所有长度必须相同，否则会发生</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可检测的非法行为。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (items, items2) |i, j| {\n        count += i + j;\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">21</span>, count);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"for reference\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> items = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 将捕获值指定为指针，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 即可通过引用遍历切片。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (&amp;items) |*value| {\n        value.* += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, items[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, items[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, items[<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>]);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"for else\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 与 while 循环一样，for 也可以带有 else。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> items = [_]?<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span> };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// for 循环也可以用作表达式。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 与 while 循环类似，从 for 循环 break 时不会求值 else 分支。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> result = <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (items) |value| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (value != <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>) {\n            sum += value.?;\n        }\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> blk: {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">12</span>, sum);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :blk sum;\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">12</span>, result);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_for.zig</kbd>\n1/4 test_for.test.for basics...OK\n2/4 test_for.test.multi object for...OK\n3/4 test_for.test.for reference...OK\n4/4 test_for.test.for else...OK\nAll 4 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <h3 id=\"Labeled-for\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/for/#Labeled-for\">带标签的 for</a></h3>\n\n      <p>为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span></code> 循环添加标签后，可以在嵌套循环中通过 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code> 或 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 引用它：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_for_nested_break.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"nested break\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> count: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    outer: <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>) |_| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>) |_| {\n            count += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :outer;\n        }\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, count);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"nested continue\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> count: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    outer: <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>) |_| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>) |_| {\n            count += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :outer;\n        }\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>, count);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_for_nested_break.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_for_nested_break.test.nested break...OK\n2/2 test_for_nested_break.test.nested continue...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"inline-for\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/for/#inline-for\">inline for</a></h3>\n\n      <p>for 循环可以内联。内联会展开循环，使代码能够执行仅在编译时可行的操作，例如将类型作为一等值使用。内联 for 循环的捕获值和迭代器值都在编译时已知。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_inline_for.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"inline for loop\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> nums = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (nums) |i| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> T = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (i) {\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">f32</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n        };\n        sum += typeNameLength(T);\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>, sum);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">typeNameLength</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeName</span>(T).len;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_inline_for.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_inline_for.test.inline for loop...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>建议仅在以下情况之一成立时使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 循环：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>需要循环在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>执行，才能实现所需语义。</li>\n        <li>已有基准测试证明，以这种方式强制展开循环会带来可测量的性能提升。</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#while\">while</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">comptime</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Slices\">切片</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      ","translation":{"total":31,"translated":31}}
